FAQs
&nbsp;

 	Is Spider-Man DC Or Marvel? 

Spider-Man belongs to Marvel. The character first appeared in Marvel Comics’ Amazing Fantasy #15, published between 1961-62, and later got his separate series in 1963.
&nbsp;

 	How Many Spider-man Movies Are There? 

Till now, there are eight high-rated Spider-Man movies that you should watch in the order; Spider-Man (2002), Spider-Man 2 (2004), Spider-Man 3 (2007), The Amazing Spider-Man (2012), The Amazing Spider-Man 2 (2014), Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017), Spider-Man: Into the Spider-Verse (2018), Spider-Man: Far From Home (2019), and the upcoming Spider-Man: No Way Home will be added to this Spider-Cinematic Universe soon as the 9th installment.
&nbsp;

 	Is Tom Holland The Only Spider-Man? 

Before Tom Holland, the other actors who have ruled the previous centuries are Tobey Maguire and Andrew Garfield.
&nbsp;

 	What’s The Basic Story Of Spider-Man No Way Home? 

No Way Home will portray Tom Holland dealing with his revealed face in front of the entire world and seeking help from Dr. Strange to fix everything with magic, which will have its unseen consequences!
&nbsp;

 	Who’s In The Leading Cast Of This Movie? 

The returning leading cast of Spider-Man: No Way Home includes Tom Holland as Peter Parker, Zendaya as MJ, Jacob Batalon as Nedd, Benedict Cumberbatch as Doctor Strange, Tony Revolori as Flash Thompson, and many other familiar faces.
&nbsp;

 	When Will The Movie Release? 

After several postponements and delays, the much-awaited Spider-Man No Way Home is finally releasing this December, and the first trailer-teaser is already out! Watch it here.
&nbsp;

 	How Many Famous Villains Are There In The Movie This Time? 

Since the cat is already out of the bag, Spider-Man: NWH will feature the famous villain group, Sinister-Six, along with Doctor Octopus, Electro, and former Spider-Mans, i.e., Tobey Maguire and Andrew Garfield.
&nbsp;

 	Will There Be A Crossover Between Spider-Man: NWH And MCU Avengers?

Despite being called the longest Spider-Man movie with multiple famous Cameos, there would be no sign of Avengers in the movie this time!

 

 	Where Can I Stream The Movie? 

Although for some time, Marvel phase 4 movies/series are mostly being streamed on Disney+, No Way Home may not be released there for sharing the co-production with Sony. So far, there’s no such revelation regarding where one can stream the movie online.
&nbsp;

 	Where Can I Find The Spider-Man Latest No Way Home Outfit Merch? 

Hollywood Leather Jackets has just released the highly in-demand Spider-Man: No Way Home-inspired outfits merch with exclusive discounts and offers! Check it all out NOW!

