Faqs
Who is Loki? 
&nbsp;
Played by the actor Tom Hiddleston, Loki is the fictional character that appears in Marvel Comics and was usually portrayed as the most sympathetic villain of all time.
&nbsp;
What’s the background of Loki in the marvel comics/movies? 
&nbsp;
Loki is the adoptive son of king Odin and Queen Frigga of Asgard, who develops the lust for power through time and tries to overtake the entire throne by evil means.
&nbsp;
Is Loki a protagonist in the latest Loki Marvel tv-series? 
&nbsp;
There’s no denying that Loki, aka God of Mischief, has anything but evil throughout the start, yet in the series, we will be seeing the character embracing the role of the protagonist.
&nbsp;
What are the powers of Loki?
&nbsp;
Being one of the most popular characters of MCU, Loki possesses superior strength, durability, and longevity compared to ordinary humans. His powers include astral projection, teleportations, and even conjuration. Further, he can even change his sex too.
&nbsp;
What will be the timeline of the new Loki series? 
&nbsp;
Since the character has the entire show to himself now, many people have questions. According to the directors, the show may connect with the original or Dr. Strange timeline at some time.
&nbsp;
So, did Loki die or not in the Endgame? 
&nbsp;
There’s not a proper confirmation about what happened, yet, some fans have suggested that Loki (the god of deception) might have cheated his death by replacing it with the fake one.
&nbsp;
Will there be other Marvel characters making cameos in the series? 
&nbsp;
For now, the production team of the Loki series has done a brilliant job at hiding any details about the appearance of other MCU characters, so we’ve got to wait & see!
&nbsp;
How many episodes will be there in the Loki tv-series? 
&nbsp;
The series will consist of a total of six episodes, each having a duration of approximately 40-45 minutes.
&nbsp;
Will there be the second season of the Loki tv-series? 
&nbsp;
Yes, Disney+ has just announced about Loki being renewed for the second season, and we couldn’t be happier! But the date isn’t out yet!
&nbsp;
How many versions of Loki will we see in the series? 
&nbsp;
Since Loki is both the god of deception and mischief; thus, the character can form multiple versions. Although there is not any confirmation about Loki’s new versions, we can expect King Loki, Kid Loki, and even Lady Loki.
&nbsp;
Will there be TVA in the Loki series as well? 
&nbsp;

AKA the Time Variance Authority, TVA is a fictional organization or a group of timeline monitors from the MCU comics that will appear in the Loki tv-series.

&nbsp;

What role will TVA play in the Loki series? 

&nbsp;

Apart from the confirmation of TVA in the Loki series, their role in the series is unknown for now and will be revealed soon.

